        <details class="group border-b border-tjb-lavender-300/40 pb-3">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer py-2 list-none">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-tjb-charcoal text-lg">What is the average cost of a doula?</h3>
            <span class="text-tjb-rose-500 text-xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed pb-2">The national average cost of a doula for a birth package is around $1,200 to $1,500. In major metropolitan areas, the average is higher, often $1,800 to $2,500. In smaller cities and rural areas, the average is closer to $800 to $1,200.</p>
        </details>
