          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer py-2 list-none">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-tjb-charcoal text-lg">How much does a postpartum doula cost?</h3>
            <span class="text-tjb-rose-500 text-xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed pb-2">Postpartum doulas typically charge $25 to $50 per hour with a four-hour minimum per visit. A typical postpartum doula package runs $400 to $1,200 depending on how many visits and hours you need. Night doulas cost more, typically $35 to $75 per hour.</p>
