            <span class="text-tjb-rose-500 text-xl transition-transform group-open:rotate-45">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed pb-2">When broken down hourly, birth doula rates typically work out to $25 to $50 per hour when you factor in the full package of prenatal visits, on-call time, labor, and postpartum visits. Postpartum doula rates are $25 to $50 per hour, and night doulas charge $35 to $75 per hour.</p>
