          </summary>
          <p class="text-tjb-gray leading-relaxed pb-2">Doula costs vary significantly by location. In major metros like New York and Los Angeles, expect $1,500 to $3,000 for a birth doula. In Texas cities like Dallas, Houston, and Austin, the range is $800 to $2,800. In smaller towns and rural areas, costs range from $650 to $1,500.</p>
        </details>
        <details class="group border-b border-tjb-lavender-300/40 pb-3">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer py-2 list-none">
